,"sense":"碎片化","alt_zh":"高中生觀察同一座地景模型，原本連成片的森林被道路與房屋分成幾小塊。","example":"The landscape model showed the fragmentation of a once-connected forest.","example_zh":"地景模型呈現原本相連的森林如何碎片化。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/fragmentation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-fraud-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"fraud","sort_order":1,"sense":"詐騙","alt_zh":"成年銀行人員向顧客展示無字假訊息示意卡，顧客停下匯款並認真聆聽。","example":"The bank warned customers about fraud involving fake messages.","example_zh":"銀行提醒顧客注意利用假訊息進行的詐騙。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/fraud-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-freelance-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"freelance","sort_order":1,"sense":"自由接案的","alt_zh":"成年插畫家在溫暖家用工作室，專注繪製無字故事書插畫。","example":"The freelance illustrator worked on book pictures from her home studio.","example_zh":"自由接案插畫家在家中工作室繪製書中插圖。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/freelance-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-freight-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"freight","sort_order":1,"sense":"貨物","alt_zh":"貨運列車沿安全鐵路行經山谷，車廂載有木材與封好的穀物袋。","example":"The freight train carried timber and grain through the valley.","example_zh":"貨運列車載著木材與穀物穿過山谷。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/freight-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-frenzy-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"frenzy","sort_order":1,"sense":"瘋狂","alt_zh":"成年攤販在突然降雨時快速收起商品與拉好雨棚，場景忙亂但安全。","example":"The sudden shower sent the market into a frenzy of hurried packing.","example_zh":"突如其來的雨，讓市場陷入匆忙收攤的混亂。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/frenzy-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-frivolous-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"frivolous","sort_order":1,"sense":"輕浮的","alt_zh":"高中生在手作店把不必要裝飾放回架上，改選需要的工具。","example":"The team avoided frivolous purchases and saved money for useful tools.","example_zh":"小組避免輕率的花費，把錢存來買實用工具。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/frivolous-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-fugitive-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"fugitive","sort_order":1,"sense":"逃犯","alt_zh":"偵探故事插畫中，成年警探在廣場找到成年逃犯，雙方平靜站著，無武器或追逐細節。","example":"The detective novel followed a fugitive who was eventually found.","example_zh":"那本偵探小說追蹤一名最終被找到的逃犯。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/fugitive-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-fundamentalism-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"fundamentalism","sort_order":1,"sense":"基本教義派","alt_zh":"高中生在老師引導下客觀比較歷史宗教書籍與不同閱讀方式，無標語或特定群體批評。","example":"The history class discussed fundamentalism and strict readings of religious texts.","example_zh":"歷史課討論基本教義派及對宗教經典的嚴格解讀。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/fundamentalism-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-fusion-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"fusion","sort_order":1,"sense":"融合","alt_zh":"成年青年樂團與穿端莊服裝的民俗舞者，在同一舞台和諧演出。","example":"The performance was a fusion of classical music and folk dance.","example_zh":"這場演出融合了古典音樂與民俗舞蹈。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/fusion-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-futility-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"futility","sort_order":1,"sense":"徒勞","alt_zh":"高中生看著已碎成很多小片的陶杯，老師拿出完整替代杯，大家放下不切實際的修補工具。","example":"The futility of repairing the shattered cup made us choose a new one.","example_zh":"修補碎裂杯子徒勞無功，讓我們決定換一個新的。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/futility-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-gadget-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"gadget","sort_order":1,"sense":"小裝置","alt_zh":"高中生把小型無字土壤濕度計插入盆土，觀察簡單燈號。","example":"The small gadget helped us measure soil moisture in the garden.","example_zh":"這個小裝置幫我們測量菜園的土壤濕度。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/gadget-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-galvanize-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"galvanize","sort_order":1,"sense":"激勵","alt_zh":"老師監督安全教育用小模型火箭活動後，高中生在安全距離開心擊掌慶祝，無製作細節。","example":"The first successful launch helped galvanize the model-rocket team.","example_zh":"第一次發射成功，激勵了模型火箭小組。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/galvanize-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-gazette-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"gazette","sort_order":1,"sense":"公報","alt_zh":"成年鎮公所人員把無可辨識文字的正式公報交給圖書館員，後方圖書館準備開門。","example":"The town gazette announced the opening of the new library.","example_zh":"城鎮公報宣布新圖書館開幕。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/gazette-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-genealogy-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"genealogy","sort_order":1,"sense":"系譜","alt_zh":"家人與高中生在桌上用老照片排出家族樹，以細線連接，無名字文字。","example":"The family used old photographs to explore its genealogy.","example_zh":"家人用老照片探索家族系譜。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/genealogy-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"ge