netic instructions.","example_zh":"教室模型把基因組呈現為一套完整的遺傳訊息。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/genome-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-geopolitical-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"geopolitical","sort_order":1,"sense":"地緣政治的","alt_zh":"高中生觀察虛構立體地圖中的狹窄海峽與兩側陸地，模型商船行經其中。","example":"The lesson examined the geopolitical importance of the narrow sea passage.","example_zh":"課程探討狹窄海峽在地緣政治上的重要性。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/geopolitical-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-geothermal-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"geothermal","sort_order":1,"sense":"地熱的","alt_zh":"地熱研究展示模型呈現地下熱水管線連到地表溫室，高中生在旁觀察，無工程細節。","example":"The town used geothermal heat to warm its public greenhouse.","example_zh":"城鎮使用地熱為公共溫室保暖。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/geothermal-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-gimmick-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"gimmick","sort_order":1,"sense":"花招","alt_zh":"手作市集攤位前，一個彩色旋轉展示吸引顧客目光，商品放在後方。","example":"The bright spinning display was a gimmick to draw people to the stall.","example_zh":"鮮亮旋轉展示是吸引人靠近攤位的花招。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/gimmick-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-glacier-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"glacier","sort_order":1,"sense":"冰川","alt_zh":"從安全遠方觀景台看巨大的藍白冰川沿高山谷地延伸。","example":"The glacier moved slowly through the high mountain valley.","example_zh":"冰川緩慢穿過高山山谷。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/glacier-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-globalization-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"globalization","sort_order":1,"sense":"全球化","alt_zh":"高中生在市場看來自不同地區的水果與香料，旁邊店主指著無字地球儀說明。","example":"The market's imported foods offered a glimpse of globalization.","example_zh":"市場裡的進口食物，讓人一窺全球化。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/globalization-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-governance-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"governance","sort_order":1,"sense":"治理","alt_zh":"高中學生會公開圍桌討論捐款物資分配，每人都有機會發言，帳冊整齊。","example":"Good governance helped the club manage donations fairly.","example_zh":"良好治理讓社團能公平管理捐款。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/governance-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-gradient-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"gradient","sort_order":1,"sense":"梯度；坡度","alt_zh":"嚮導帶高中生沿有護欄的陡坡步道緩慢上行。","example":"The trail's steep gradient made the final climb tiring.","example_zh":"步道陡峭的坡度，讓最後一段攀爬很費力。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/gradient-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-grandeur-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"grandeur","sort_order":1,"sense":"壯觀","alt_zh":"高中生走入高挑拱頂、精緻陽台與宏大舞台的老劇院，抬頭讚嘆。","example":"The grandeur of the old theater left the visitors amazed.","example_zh":"老劇院的壯觀讓參觀者驚嘆。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/grandeur-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-grassroots-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"grassroots","sort_order":1,"sense":"草根的","alt_zh":"一般社區居民與高中生自發拿掃具清理住家街道，沒有官員或標誌。","example":"The grassroots campaign began with neighbors cleaning their own street.","example_zh":"這場草根運動從鄰居一起清掃自家街道開始。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/grassroots-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-gratification-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"gratification","sort_order":1,"sense":"滿足","alt_zh":"高中生自豪地看著完成的精緻模型橋，露出滿足微笑。","example":"Finishing the difficult model brought a deep sense of gratification.","example_zh":"完成困難模型，帶來深深的滿足感。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/gratification-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-gravitation-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"gravitation","sort_order":1,"sense":"重力","alt_zh":"科學老師在地板上方低處放開小球，旁邊有無字地球儀，高中生觀察。","example":"The teacher used a globe and a falling ball to introduce gravitation.","example_zh":"老師用地球儀與落球介紹重力。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/gravitation-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-greenhouse-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"greenhouse","sort_order":1,"sense":"溫室","alt_zh":"高中生在透明溫室裡照顧健康幼苗，外面可見寒冷天氣與薄霜。","example":"The greenhouse kept the young plants warm during the cold week.","example_zh":"寒冷的一週裡，溫室讓幼苗保持溫暖。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/greenhouse-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-grievance-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"grievance","sort_order":1,"sense":"不滿","alt_zh":"高中隊長認真聽隊員表達練習安排的不滿，大家圍坐冷靜討論。","example":"The captain listened to each teammate's grievance before changing the schedule.","example_zh":"隊長先傾聽每位隊友的不滿，再調整練習時間表。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/grievance-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-guerrilla-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"guerrilla","sort_order":1,"sense":"游擊隊","alt_zh":"高中生在歷史博物館看舊背包、水壺與望遠鏡的展櫃，無武器或戰鬥。","example":"The museum displayed equipment once used by a guerrilla.","example_zh":"博物館展示一位游擊隊員曾使用的裝備。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/guerrilla-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-guideline-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"guideline","sort_order":1,"sense":"準則","alt_zh":"老師指著只有安全圖示的說明板，高中生把工坊工具分類放回安全位置。","example":"The safety guideline helped us arrange the workshop tools correctly.","example_zh":"安全準則幫助我們正確擺放工坊工具。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/guideline-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-hallmark-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"hallmark","sort_order":1,"sense":"特質","alt_zh":"成年老提琴師向高中生展示提琴接縫與雕刻細節，做工精緻整齊。","example":"Careful craftsmanship was the hallmark of the old violin maker's work.","example_zh":"細緻手藝是那位老提琴製作師作品的特色。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/hallmark-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-hallucination-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"hallucination","sort_order":1,"sense":"幻覺","alt_zh":"虛構故事中，成年旅人坐在安全旅館的椅子上，旁邊空椅上浮現淡淡想像中的同伴輪廓，柔和不恐怖。","example":"The novel described a traveler's hallucination of a companion who was not really there.","example_zh":"小說描寫旅人產生幻覺，看見其實不在身旁的同伴。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/hallucination-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-hasten-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"hasten","sort_order":1,"sense":"加速","alt_zh":"老師帶高中生沿安全步道加快走向附近堅固避雨棚，遠方烏雲漸近。","example":"The approaching rain made us hasten back to the shelter.","example_zh":"雨勢即將到來，讓我們加快腳步返回避雨處。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/