y tree to discuss hereditary traits.","example_zh":"班上使用家族樹討論遺傳特徵。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/hereditary-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-hindrance-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"hindrance","sort_order":1,"sense":"障礙","alt_zh":"高中健行隊在安全距離停下，看前方倒樹擋住狹窄步道。","example":"The fallen tree was a hindrance to anyone using the narrow trail.","example_zh":"倒樹是所有使用狹窄步道者的障礙。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/hindrance-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-holistic-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"holistic","sort_order":1,"sense":"全面的","alt_zh":"高中生與老師一起查看社區花園模型，同時考慮居民座椅、水源、植物與鳥類棲地。","example":"The teacher took a holistic view of the project, considering people and nature.","example_zh":"老師從全面角度看專題，把人與自然都納入考量。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/holistic-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-homage-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"homage","sort_order":1,"sense":"敬意","alt_zh":"高中樂團在小音樂廳向坐在觀眾席的敬愛老師演奏，老師感動微笑。","example":"The students performed the old song as an homage to their music teacher.","example_zh":"學生演奏老歌，向音樂老師致敬。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/homage-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","version":1},{"id":"senior-homestead-01-v1","level":"senior","word":"homestead","sort_order":1,"sense":"家園","alt_zh":"溫暖鄉間家園中，家人在小屋、果樹與菜圃之間一起工作。","example":"The family's homestead included a cottage, orchard, and vegetable patch.","example_zh":"這家人的家園有小屋、果園與菜圃。","image_url":"https://jbspxqebcrkilfcddluo.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/word-illustrations/senior/homestead-01-v1.webp","local_path":"","style":"generated-senior-v1","versi